{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "33fe8d00-169c-44d9-beb6-3fc46bb0ba23",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "e86a5fc8-252b-4ec9-b5a9-bc6a162b187c",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "a9fdcc0f-2c57-448d-a31a-beeda65fe1dd",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Table completeness (rules/system/table-completeness)"
      },
      {
        "id": "5a9405f0-695f-47c1-9126-49344ab0d62c",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Reference integrity (rules/system/reference-integrity)"
      },
      {
        "id": "0734e9ae-93ee-4f3f-b110-c8863b815a3f",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Status discipline (rules/system/status-discipline)"
      },
      {
        "id": "18c6bb0f-44b2-4753-a979-3edf20432d08",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Graph-first navigation (rules/system/graph-first-navigation)"
      },
      {
        "id": "90afe35e-ac75-4ecc-8c1b-c9ec7bb34795",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Extraction — completeness standard (rules/system/extraction-standard)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "2e4d8bc8-f21f-4ac7-a7f8-1ab31274833e",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "d3e2e66e-fe3e-476a-b451-ff4f0ffeb035",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "1007cb23-44e1-4490-890d-f0ed00b3d1a1",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "Batches of created models/structures/contracts/workflows, linked and code-linked, with a progress report of what remains.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "deaabea4-4e9c-487e-8701-ce4b095046f9",
        "text": "A fresh map (map --fresh) — the hubs drive the domain inventory"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Onboard an existing app: extract the whole project into pebbles (first run)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "75e4f155-3dc0-4d44-8a84-071da64b7c19",
        "text": "Onboard this project — extract the ENTIRE existing codebase into the spec graph: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "bb44304a-37f2-48c6-935b-afc6c00d8826",
        "text": "This is first-time onboarding of an existing app (a whole-app reverse extraction — NOT scoping a ticket). Steps, in order: (1) \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" map --fresh — required; note byLanguage + hubs (the most-imported files ARE the domain core). (2) From hubs and map-search, inventory the domain: models/entities, DTOs/structures, API contracts (routes/controllers), and the key workflows. (3) Work in batches by domain area — for each item, read the source the graph points to, then \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" create <section> --title \"...\" --content {…} with the real extracted shape, and link-code its source files. Use map-neighbors to find what belongs together. (4) Status implemented for everything extracted. (5) Report progress per batch (created N models, M structures…) and what remains — for a large app, propose continuing in a follow-up run rather than truncating silently."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "81a1f156-55a3-4632-acdf-38686642dc51",
        "text": "Each batch reports created pebbles with counts; nothing failed silently"
      },
      {
        "id": "240aa640-d474-4e4e-9a74-bcf27bdcbf12",
        "text": "Cross-model FKs between created models are refKey-wired (second pass after both exist)"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "First-run onboarding of an existing app: inventory the domain from the map's hubs and batch-create the spec graph."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.780Z",
